  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - 1.The proposed house by reason of its excessive size,bulk,position and appearance would result in the formation of a terrace of three properties which would be out of character with the other properties in the street scene and would constitute an obtrusive feature detrimental to the amenities of the adjoining residential property and the street scene generally.it is therefore contrary to policies ENV1.1 and H3.4 of the UDP and ENVb1.1 and H6.4 of the Review UDP.\r\n2The proposed house would have inadequate parking provision and the resultant on street parking would be likely to cause conditions prejudicial to the free flow of traffic and general safety on the highway and amenities of adjoining residents.It is therefore contrary to policy T2.5 and T1.4 of the Review Deposit UDP"
  ],
